        "id": 153719,
        "name": "riff.freelance",
        "username": "riff.freelance",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/riff.freelance/{size}/2050_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-22T02:05:09.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) My favorite Hero is Absolute Zero! (Wraith and Tachyon tie second)</p><p>2) My favorite Regular Style Villain is Ennead!</p><p>3) My favorite Vengence Style Villain is Really not sure yet, I don't play V style much and have no opinion yet.</p><p>4) My favorite Environment is Realm of Discord and Insula Primalis!</p><p>5) My favorite Hero Promo is Legacies or Tachyons! Most are awesome so too tough to call.</p><p>6) My favorite Villain Promo is Tie: Gloomweaver or Omnitron! Honorable mention; Spite is much more playable in promo form.</p><p>7) My favorite Sentinels Expansion is ALL OF THEM! Nod to Shattered Timelines, but seriously all are awesome.</p><p>8) My favorite Character Backstory is Omnitron X! Just kinda nifty.</p><p>9) My favorite Card Art is All the Hero flipsides that call out to famous comic covers.</p><p>10) My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is Omnitron v Omnitron X in Omnitron IV!!</p>",
