        "created_at": "2016-01-23T05:25:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Well... I guess I may as well join in...</p><p>1) My favorite Hero is KNYFE!</p><p>2) My favorite Regular Style Villain is Citizen Dawn!</p><p>3) My favorite Vengence Style Villain is Proletariat (still haven't played Villians yet...)!</p><p>4) My favorite Environment is Realm of Discord!</p><p>5) My favorite Hero Promo is Dark Watch Mr Fixer!</p><p>6) My favorite Villain Promo is Gloomweaver's (I forget what it's called...)!</p><p>7) My favorite Sentinels Expansion is Wrath of the Cosmos!</p><p>8) My favorite Character Backstory is Deadline!</p><p>9) My favorite Card Art is Hollow Points!</p><p>10) My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is Tempest vs Voss!</p><div>&nbsp;</div>",
