        "created_at": "2016-01-24T13:14:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) My favorite Hero is Tempest or Fanatic!</p><p>2) My favorite Regular Style Villain is Citizen Dawn!</p><p>3) My favorite Vengence Style Villain is Proletariat!</p><p>4) My favorite Environment is Time Cataclysm!</p><p>5) My favorite Hero Promo is Prime Wardens Argent Adept!</p><p>6) My favorite Villain Promo is Baron Blade</p><p>7) My favorite Sentinels Expansion is Infernal Relics!</p><p>8) My favorite Character Backstory is The Visionary!</p><p>9) My favorite Card Art is basically any card from the Realm of Discord deck!</p><p>10) My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is Argent Adept vs Akash'Bhuta!</p>",
