        "created_at": "2016-01-27T02:35:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<div>&nbsp;</div><div>\n<p>1) My favorite Hero is &nbsp; &nbsp;NIGHTMIST!!!! (maybe Pinon in a year)</p>\n<p>2) My favorite Regular Style Villain is Pinon, &nbsp; err A 1st turn Brain Burned Chairman!</p>\n<p>3) My favorite Vengence Style Villain is La Capitan with a Shout out to the Impeccable Pompadour!</p>\n<p>4) My favorite Environment is Time Cataclysm<span>!</span></p>\n<p>5) My favorite Hero Promo is Dark Watch Setback!</p>\n<p>6) My favorite Villain Promo is Kismet (I like her consept at lease)!</p>\n<p>7) My favorite Sentinels Expansion is Shattered Timelines!</p>\n<p>8) My favorite Character Backstory is Nightmist!</p>\n<p>9) My favorite Card Art is &nbsp;¿Quando? ¡AHORA! &nbsp; *Note to Resetion Darts V5Blade's deck spell check later*</p>\n<p>10) My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is &nbsp;Mr Fixer VS Chairman vs True Form Vs Vengence Opertaive!</p>\n</div><p>&nbsp;</p>",
