        "created_at": "2016-01-31T15:57:59.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>&nbsp;</p><p>1) My favorite Hero is Absolute Zero!</p><p>2) My favorite Regular Style Villain is La Capitan!</p><p>3) My favorite Vengeance Style Villain is Fright Train!</p><p>4) My favorite Environment is Mobile Defense Platform!</p><p>5) My favorite Hero Promo is G.I. Bunker!</p><p>6) My favorite Villain Promo is Mad Bomber Blade!</p><p>7) My favorite Sentinels Expansion is Shattered Timelines!</p><p>8) My favorite Character Backstory is Chrono-Ranger! (because he sees a rift in time &amp; space and just. walks. in.)</p><p>9) My favorite Card Art is Mad Bomber Blade's Death Ray Side! (he's so happy!)</p><p>10) My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is Captain Cosmic v Infinitor! (Though, shoutout to Iron Legacy vs any 5 of the Freedom 6! Short and brutal.)</p>",
