        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/mcbehrer/{size}/1850_2.png",
        "created_at": "2016-01-31T17:33:12.000Z",
        "cooked": "<ol>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Hero is a several-way tie between Argent Adept, NightMist, Setback, and Guise!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Regular Style Villain is La Capitan! (With The Ennead as a close second)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Vengence Style Villain is La Capitan! Big surprise!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Environment is Insula Primalis!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Hero Promo is Santa Guise!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Villain Promo is Tormented Ally Infinitor!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Sentinels Expansion is maybe Internal Relics… But probably just all of them!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Character Backstory is Deadline, easy!</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Card Art is… Not so easy. Everyman’s Strength, Engine of Destruction, Quando? Ahora!, Impeccable Pompadour, all of the Enclave, Alchemical Redirection, Wrong Time and Place, Retcon, (most of Guise’s deck, really), there are just… SO many options! I’m going to go with Retcon, because it’s funny, but the whole game wins, really.</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>My favorite Nemesis Matchup (A hero vs their nemesis) is KNYFE vs Progeny!</p>\n</li>\n</ol>",
